---
// About.astro (Nouval Adha Sentanu — Profil & Perjalanan Belajar)
---

<section id="profil" class="py-20 sm:py-28 border-b border-[#E2E8F0] relative">
  
  <!-- Architectural Corner Crosshairs (+) -->
  <span class="crosshair-corner top-0 left-4 sm:left-8 -translate-y-1/2">+</span>
  <span class="crosshair-corner top-0 right-4 sm:right-8 -translate-y-1/2">+</span>

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
    
    <!-- Section Identifier Tag -->
    <div class="mb-12 fade-up-element">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mono-label text-[#0052FF] font-semibold mb-2 bg-blue-50/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-blue-200 text-xs">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0052FF]"></span>
        <span>Tentang Saya</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-[#0A192F]">
        Eksplorasi Teknologi, Kode & Desain Kreatif
      </h2>
      <p class="body-editorial body-constrained mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#475569]">
        Perjalanan belajar siswa jurusan Pengembangan Perangkat Lunak dan Gim (PPLG) dalam mewujudkan ide digital yang bermanfaat dan nyaman digunakan.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial 2-Column Split -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
      
      <!-- Narrative (7 cols) with Exact User Authentic Bio -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-5 fade-up-element">
        
        <p class="body-editorial body-constrained text-lg text-[#0A192F] font-medium leading-relaxed">
          Halo! Saya adalah seorang siswa jurusan <strong class="text-[#0052FF] font-semibold">Pengembangan Perangkat Lunak dan Gim (PPLG)</strong> yang memiliki ketertarikan besar di bidang teknologi, pemrograman, dan desain.
        </p>

        <p class="body-editorial body-constrained text-[#475569]">
          Saya senang mempelajari hal-hal baru, mencoba berbagai ide kreatif, serta mengembangkan kemampuan melalui latihan dan proyek sederhana. Bagi saya, setiap proses belajar adalah kesempatan untuk berkembang dan menciptakan sesuatu yang bermanfaat.
        </p>

        <!-- Focus Cards with Dimensional Soft Shadow & Glow -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4">
          
          <div class="interactive-card p-4 rounded-2xl space-y-1.5">
            <div class="mono-label text-[#0052FF] font-bold text-xs flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#0052FF] rounded-full"></span>
              <span>Fokus 01: Coding & Web</span>
            </div>
            <p class="body-editorial text-xs leading-normal text-[#475569]">
              Mempelajari logika pemrograman web, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, dan algoritma dasar.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="interactive-card p-4 rounded-2xl space-y-1.5">
            <div class="mono-label text-[#0052FF] font-bold text-xs flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#0052FF] rounded-full"></span>
              <span>Fokus 02: Desain Visual & 3D</span>
            </div>
            <p class="body-editorial text-xs leading-normal text-[#475569]">
              Merancang antarmuka UI/UX di Figma dan pemodelan objek 3D di Blender dengan panduan ide modern.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Profile Summary Card (5 cols) with Soft Shadow & Glow -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 interactive-card rounded-2xl overflow-hidden fade-up-element">
        
        <div class="bg-[#F8FAFC] px-5 py-3.5 border-b border-[#E2E8F0] flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="font-heading font-bold text-sm text-[#0A192F]">Ringkasan Profil</span>
          <span class="mono-label text-[#0052FF] font-semibold text-xs bg-blue-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg border border-blue-200">Siswa PPLG</span>
        </div>

        <div class="divide-y divide-[#E2E8F0] text-xs">
          
          <div class="p-4 flex items-center justify-between hover:bg-[#F8FAFC]/50 transition-colors">
            <div>
              <div class="mono-label text-[#64748B] text-[10px]">NAMA LENGKAP</div>
              <div class="font-heading font-bold text-[#0A192F] text-sm mt-0.5">Nouval Adha Sentanu</div>
            </div>
            <span class="mono-label text-[#0052FF] text-[11px] font-semibold">Aktif</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 flex items-center justify-between hover:bg-[#F8FAFC]/50 transition-colors">
            <div>
              <div class="mono-label text-[#64748B] text-[10px]">MINAT & PERAN</div>
              <div class="font-heading font-bold text-[#0A192F] text-sm mt-0.5">Web Developer & Desainer</div>
            </div>
            <span class="mono-label text-[#0052FF] text-[11px] font-semibold">Teknologi & Desain</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 flex items-center justify-between hover:bg-[#F8FAFC]/50 transition-colors">
            <div>
              <div class="mono-label text-[#64748B] text-[10px]">ASAL SEKOLAH</div>
              <div class="font-heading font-bold text-[#0A192F] text-sm mt-0.5">SMK Negeri 9 Semarang</div>
            </div>
            <span class="mono-label text-[#0052FF] text-[11px] font-semibold">PPLG</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 flex items-center justify-between hover:bg-[#F8FAFC]/50 transition-colors">
            <div>
              <div class="mono-label text-[#64748B] text-[10px]">TUJUAN BELAJAR</div>
              <div class="font-heading font-bold text-[#0A192F] text-sm mt-0.5">Kreatif, Inovatif, & Profesional</div>
            </div>
            <span class="mono-label text-[#0052FF] text-[11px] font-semibold">Berkembang</span>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="p-4 bg-[#F8FAFC] border-t border-[#E2E8F0] mono-label text-xs text-[#64748B] flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Portofolio Siswa</span>
          <span class="text-[#0052FF] font-semibold">SMKN 9 Semarang</span>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
